  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att driva och utveckla prim&#xE4;rv&#xE5;rden i  Gihundwe-distriktet i Rwanda. Projektet b&#xF6;rjade som katastrofhj&#xE4;lp men har nu utvecklats till mer regulj&#xE4;r utvecklingsverksamhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at developing and sustaining primary health care in the Gihundwe-district in Rwanda. It started of as an emergency project, but has now develope din to a more regular development project.</narrative>
  </description>
